      "message": "fix(cl): the text dump, is_prismatic and TiltedFrame keep the stated spindle C\n\ncl::text wrote a C-live path without its C angle and is_prismatic read\nit as a 3-axis path; TiltedFrame rebuilt moves with rotary: None\n(#295). The dump now writes and reads the golden writer's SC word, a\npath stating C is not prismatic (so the dump is v4), and world_path\ncopies the angle onto every move it maps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
